WEBVTT

00:18:27.954 --> 00:18:31.954
As New York City shut down, their entire
livelihood was now in question.

00:18:32.079 --> 00:18:36.954
My colleague Ercan sent an
email to three of us and

00:18:36.954 --> 00:18:40.163
the subject was either Sant'Angelo and the
body was, what are we going to do?

00:18:40.621 --> 00:18:44.371
In New York? Street vendors were excluded
from pandemic relief programs.

00:18:44.579 --> 00:18:46.288
So Mike sprang into action.

00:18:46.746 --> 00:18:48.329
He helped him set up a Venmo account

00:18:48.496 --> 00:18:51.538
and employees from Morgan Stanley
rallied together to contribute.

00:18:52.163 --> 00:18:54.454
Then they organized a virtual
breakfast with Edith

00:18:54.454 --> 00:18:58.204
and Angelo to collect donations, and
it just snowballed from there.

00:18:58.954 --> 00:19:01.204
We were very surprised. We were amazed.